content.content:
{
    "type": "Collection",
    "id": "facilities",
    "stac_version": "1.1.0",
    "description": "Facility and membership layers for Brazilian soft-commodity supply chains. One\nunified layer plus the components it's built from. Geometry is WGS84 (EPSG:4326).\n\n## The files\n\n- **`BR_facilities`** \u2014 the unified layer, every entity as one row across all\n  tiers (40,669 features: facility points + municipality polygons). This is the\n  one to start with. Columns: `entity_id, entity_kind, tier, weight, basis,\n  geom_method, source, geometry`.\n- **`BR_intake_points`** \u2014 grain silos from CONAB (18,802): cooperative, trader,\n  and official, with registered coordinates and static capacity in tonnes.\n- **`BR_buyer_points`** \u2014 federal (SIF) slaughterhouses & dairy plants (1,514),\n  geocoded, tagged by commodity (beef/poultry/pork/dairy).\n- **`BR_sisbi_points`** \u2014 state/municipal (SISBI) slaughterhouses & dairy plants\n  (11,582), the frontier long tail, via Trase, with `inspection_level`\n  (SIE/SIM/CONSORCIO).\n- **`BR_mill_points`** \u2014 sugar/ethanol mills from ANP (417), town-centroid,\n  with production capacity in m\u00b3/day.\n- **`BR_membership_muni`** \u2014 cooperative-member farm counts per munic\u00edpio (5,257),\n  joined to municipality polygons.\n- **`BR_muni`** \u2014 IBGE municipality boundaries (5,570), the geography everything\n  keys to.\n\n## Tiers (in `BR_facilities.tier`)\n\n`intake_point` grain silos \u00b7 `slaughter_point` animal-product buyers (SIF+SISBI) \u00b7\n`mill_point` sugar/ethanol mills \u00b7 `membership_muni` cooperative-member density \u00b7\n`gravity_catchment` modelled silo draw-areas (the only `modelled` rows).\n",
    "links": [
        {
            "rel": "root",
            "href": "..\\catalog.json",
            "type": "application/json"
        },
        {
            "rel": "parent",
            "href": "..\\catalog.json",
            "type": "application/json"
        }
    ],
    "stac_extensions": [
        "https://stac-extensions.github.io/table/v1.2.0/schema.json"
    ],
    "geoparquet:feature_count": 11582,
    "table:row_count": 83811,
    "table:primary_geometry": "geometry",
    "table:columns": [
        {
            "name": "nr_sif",
            "type": "string",
            "description": "SIF federal inspection registration number."
        },
        {
            "name": "cnpj",
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Brazilian company tax id (CNPJ)."
        },
        {
            "name": "razao_social",
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Registered legal company name (SIF)."
        },
        {
            "name": "municipio_nome",
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Municipality name."
        },
        {
            "name": "uf",
            "type": "string",
            "description": "State (UF) abbreviation."
        },
        {
            "name": "logradouro",
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Street address."
        },
        {
            "name": "cep",
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Postal code (CEP)."
        },
        {
            "name": "capacity_band",
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Slaughter capacity band from SIF (gt80_h/40_80_h/20_40_h/lt20_h)."
        },
        {
            "name": "entity_kind",
            "type": "string",
            "description": "cooperative | trader | official (silos) | buyer (slaughter/dairy) | mill."
        },
        {
            "name": "commodity",
            "type": "string",
            "description": "beef, poultry, pork, dairy, sugar_ethanol, lamb, goat, or rabbit."
        },
        {
            "name": "lat",
            "type": "double",
            "description": "Latitude, WGS84."
        },
        {
            "name": "lon",
            "type": "double",
            "description": "Longitude, WGS84."
        },
        {
            "name": "geom_method",
            "type": "string",
            "description": "How the coordinate was set: registered (source GPS), geocoded (from an address), or municipality_centroid."
        },
        {
            "name": "basis",
            "type": "string",
            "description": "observed (recorded by an official source) or modelled (computed by us; only gravity_catchment)."
        },
        {
            "name": "geometry",
            "type": "binary",
            "description": "Geometry as WKB, WGS84 (EPSG:4326). Points for facilities; polygons for municipality/catchment rows."
        },
        {
            "name": "entity_id",
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Unique id of the facility or entity within its source registry."
        },
        {
            "name": "tier",
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Layer this row belongs to: intake_point, slaughter_point, mill_point, membership_muni, or gravity_catchment."
        },
        {
            "name": "weight",
            "type": "double",
            "description": "Size measure whose unit depends on tier: tonnes (silos), capacity band 1-4 (SIF), m3/day (mills), member count (membership)."
        },
        {
            "name": "source",
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Origin registry: CONAB, MAPA-SIF, Trase-SISBI, ANP, or IBGE-6848."
        },
        {
            "name": "cda",
            "type": "string"
        },
        {
            "name": "especie",
            "type": "string"
        },
        {
            "name": "tipo",
            "type": "string"
        },
        {
            "name": "tipo_entidade",
            "type": "string",
            "description": "CONAB operator type: COOPERATIVA, PRIVADA, OFICIAL."
        },
        {
            "name": "cod_ibge",
            "type": "string",
            "description": "IBGE 7-digit municipality code."
        },
        {
            "name": "capacity_t",
            "type": "double",
            "description": "Static storage capacity in tonnes (CONAB silos)."
        },
        {
            "name": "cap_exp_t",
            "type": "double"
        },

